{
  "sn18.1:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 18.1 ",
  "sn18.1:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn18.1:0.3": "Cakkhusutta ",
  "sn18.1:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn18.1:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn18.1:1.3": "Atha kho āyasmā rāhulo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā rāhulo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn18.1:1.4": "“sādhu me, bhante, bhagavā saṅkhittena dhammaṁ desetu, yamahaṁ bhagavato dhammaṁ sutvā eko vūpakaṭṭho appamatto ātāpī pahitatto vihareyyan”ti. ",
  "sn18.1:2.1": "“Taṁ kiṁ maññasi, rāhula, ",
  "sn18.1:2.2": "cakkhuṁ niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:2.3": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn18.1:2.4": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vā taṁ sukhaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:2.5": "“Dukkhaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn18.1:2.6": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vipariṇāmadhammaṁ, kallaṁ nu taṁ samanupassituṁ: ",
  "sn18.1:2.7": "‘etaṁ mama, esohamasmi, eso me attā’”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:2.8": "“No hetaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn18.1:3.1": "“Sotaṁ niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:3.2": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante” …pe…. ",
  "sn18.1:3.3": "“Ghānaṁ niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:3.4": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante” … ",
  "sn18.1:3.5": "“Jivhā niccā vā aniccā vā”ti? ",
  "sn18.1:3.6": "“Aniccā, bhante” … ",
  "sn18.1:3.7": "�